# Click Click — Paper Stock : staff login (HTTP Basic auth)
#
# The live folder is /PaperStock/  (capital P + S — /stock/ 404s).
# AuthUserFile must be the ABSOLUTE server path to .htpasswd inside that folder.
# This prefix is taken from the working /flyers/ gate on the same Infomaniak account.
#
# If the login does NOT appear after upload, the path below is wrong: upload
# whereami.php alongside this file, open https://clickclick.be/PaperStock/whereami.php,
# paste the line it prints over the AuthUserFile line below, re-upload, then DELETE
# whereami.php.

AuthType Basic
AuthName "Click Click — Paper Stock"
AuthUserFile /home/clients/bb59b9bb68f9d5f0bbd421f23f3ae8ed/.htpasswd-paperstock
Require valid-user
